and</text><text start="1720.559" dur="5.041">personally pocketing $370,000</text><text start="1723.279" dur="4.88">from data centers. And now she&amp;#39;s teaming</text><text start="1725.6" dur="6.64">up with Abdul Aled, the Midwest mom,</text><text start="1728.159" dur="5.681">Donnie, to impose a socialist agenda</text><text start="1732.24" dur="3.76">that has never worked anywhere it&amp;#39;s been</text><text start="1733.84" dur="5.04">tried.</text><text start="1736" dur="5.44">150 years ago, Lincoln warned, &amp;quot;America</text><text start="1738.88" dur="5.2">will not be destroyed from the outside.</text><text start="1741.44" dur="4.56">If we falter, if we lose our freedoms,</text><text start="1744.08" dur="3.839">it&amp;#39;ll be because we destroyed ourselves.</text><text start="1746" dur="3.44">A century later, Reagan warned us,</text><text start="1747.919" dur="3.441">&amp;quot;Freedom is never more than one</text><text start="1749.44" dur="3.44">generation away from extinction. Freedom</text><text start="1751.36" dur="3.199">is not something we pass along to our</text><text start="1752.88" dur="3.6">children in the bloodstream. It must be</text><text start="1754.559" dur="5.641">fought for, protected, and handed to</text><text start="1756.48" dur="3.72">them to do the same.&amp;quot;</text><text start="1765.2" dur="5.12">But check this out.</text><text start="1767.2" dur="5.68">Lincoln didn&amp;#39;t fight the Civil War just</text><text start="1770.32" dur="4.4">to beat the South. He in the Republican</text><text start="1772.88" dur="4.64">party that was founded in the state of</text><text start="1774.72" dur="4.72">Michigan stood up to end up the physical</text><text start="1777.52" dur="4.399">bondage of black people and keep this</text><text start="1779.44" dur="4.239">nation together. And today, because of</text><text start="1781.919" dur="3.681">you, because of you spreading the word</text><text start="1783.679" dur="3.841">and voting, we will stand up against</text><text start="1785.6" dur="5.88">socialism and hold our state together</text><text start="1787.52" dur="3.96">for the future of our children.</text><text start="1796.24" dur="5.2">This is not only about defeating leftist</text><text start="1799.12" dur="4.799">Democrats. We must make it about freeing</text><text start="1801.44" dur="5.04">those trapped in political and economic</text><text start="1803.919" dur="4.401">bondage in our cities and winning back a</text><text start="1806.48" dur="4.319">generation that has been turned towards</text><text start="1808.32" dur="4.32">socialism on our campuses. We will</text><text start="1810.799" dur="4">counter the socialist movement of envy</text><text start="1812.64" dur="4.399">and confiscation with a conservative</text><text start="1814.799" dur="4.48">movement of access and opportunity. We</text><text start="1817.039" dur="4.24">must show this generation that free will</text><text start="1819.279" dur="3.76">and free enterprise still benefit each</text><text start="1821.279" dur="3.28">and every single one of us without</text><text start="1823.039" dur="3.76">sacrificing compassion and</text><text start="1824.559" dur="4.72">conscientiousness for all of us. That&amp;#39;s</text><text start="1826.799" dur="4.801">how we win. That&amp;#39;s how America wins and</text><text start="1829.279" dur="4.721">that is how we change the future.</text><text start="1831.6" dur="7.4">President Trump is back in Michigan</text><text start="1834" dur="5">today because he see Yes,</text><text start="1842.399" dur="4.16">President Trump is back in Michigan</text><text start="1844.399" dur="5.041">today because he sees what the rest of</text><text start="1846.559" dur="5.441">the country misses. He sees a state</text><text start="1849.44" dur="4.479">built by people just like you who</text><text start="1852" dur="4">started with nothing and built</text><text start="1853.919" dur="4.24">everything. auto workers, farmers,</text><text start="1856" dur="4.48">engineers, small business owners, the</text><text start="1858.159" dur="4.4">people who still show up, still build,</text><text start="1860.48" dur="5.4">and still believe this place can be</text><text start="1862.559" dur="3.321">great again.</text><text start="1868.559" dur="3.6">He knows that Michigan was never meant</text><text start="1870.32" dur="4.079">to be the last in the nation. Not an</text><text start="1872.159" dur="4.24">education, not an economy, not an</text><text start="1874.399" dur="4.081">infrastructure, and not while Democrats</text><text start="1876.399" dur="4.081">in Lancing are more focused on fixing</text><text start="1878.48" dur="3.52">the blame than fixing our problems.</text><text start="1880.48" dur="3.6">Michigan voters are done with the</text><text start="1882" dur="3.919">excuses. They&amp;#39;re tired of being told</text><text start="1884.08" dur="3.76">this is the best that we can do. They&amp;#39;re</text><text start="1885.919" dur="3.601">ready for leadership. They&amp;#39;re ready for</text><text start="1887.84" dur="3.52">change. They&amp;#39;re ready for someone who</text><text start="1889.52" dur="3.519">sees the same greatness in the state the</text><text start="1891.36" dur="3.919">president sees and is willing to fight</text><text start="1893.039" dur="3.921">for it. I am that man. I am that</text><text start="1895.279" dur="5.961">warrior. And I will continue to fight</text><text start="1896.96" dur="4.28">for each and every single one of you.</text><text start="1907.279" dur="5.76">My brothers and sisters, I did not fight</text><text start="1909.12" dur="5.679">in Iraq to lose this war here at home.</text><text start="1913.039" dur="4">I&amp;#39;ve never left anyone behind on the</text><text start="1914.799" dur="6.281">battlefield. And I&amp;#39;m not about to start</text><text start="1917.039" dur="4.041">leaving Michigan behind today.</text><text start="1922.64" dur="5.6">Nine days. Nine days for the rest of our</text><text start="1925.919" dur="4.161">lives. Nine days. We need to vote like</text><text start="1928.24" dur="4.24">Michigan&amp;#39;s future depends on it because</text><text start="1930.08" dur="4.88">it does. Talk to everyone you know.</text><text start="1932.48" dur="4.72">Leave no stone unturned. It&amp;#39;s time for a</text><text start="1934.96" dur="4.079">change. So, God bless you. God bless</text><text start="1937.2" dur="6.12">Michigan and God bless the United States</text><text start="1939.039" dur="4.281">of America. Thank you for coming.</text><text start="1970.96" dur="8.92">Please welcome the Republican nominee</text><text start="1973.919" dur="5.961">for the United States Senate, Mike</text><text start="2005.519" dur="4.16">All right.</text><text start="2007.679" dur="6.281">I think some people are fired up to</text><text start="2009.679" dur="4.281">defend freedom in November.</text><text start="2017.279" dur="5.361">Man, do we have a phenomenal Republican</text><text start="2019.84" dur="5.76">ticket this year? Unbelievable.</text><text start="2022.64" dur="5.44">Yeah.</text><text start="2025.6" dur="5.12">And I have to tell you something</text><text start="2028.08" dur="5.04">happened recently.</text><text start="2030.72" dur="4.4">And after that August date, this</text><text start="2033.12" dur="4.72">election became bigger than Christie and</text><text start="2035.12" dur="6.08">I. It really became bigger bigger than</text><text start="2037.84" dur="6.959">the United States Senate. This really is</text><text start="2041.2" dur="6.959">about the heart and soul of our country.</text><text start="2044.799" dur="3.36">Yeah, you bet.</text><text start="2050" dur="3.56">Yeah, you bet.</text><text start="2055.679" dur="6.48">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Awesome. USA.</text><text start="2058.96" dur="7.879">Love it. Fantastic.</text><text start="2062.159" dur="4.68">I&amp;#39;m glad you&amp;#39;re fired up. This is great.</text><text start="2068.24" dur="4.48">But something else happened.</text><text start="2070.8" dur="4.879">My wife and I got a call from a leading</text><text start="2072.72" dur="4.639">Democrat down in the city of Detroit</text><text start="2075.679" dur="3.121">and said, &amp;quot;I want you to come down and</text><text start="2077.359" dur="2.8">have a conversation with us.&amp;quot; So, we</text><text start="2078.8" dur="2.64">packed up, went down, said, &amp;quot;Are we</text><text start="2080.159" dur="2.641">allowed to show our face or do we have</text><text start="2081.44" dur="3.679">to wear, you know, some kind of</text><text start="2082.8" dur="3.76">disguise?&amp;quot;</text><text start="2085.119" dur="3.921">She said, &amp;quot;No, I want people to see</text><text start="2086.56" dur="3.68">you.&amp;quot; We got down, we talked to this</text><text start="2089.04" dur="3.76">leading Democrat. It was supposed to be</text><text start="2090.24" dur="4.08">a 45 minute two and a half hours later.</text><text start="2092.8" dur="3.52">She said, &amp;quot;Listen, I&amp;#39;m going to take you</text><text start="2094.32" dur="3.92">around the city and talk about what you</text><text start="2096.32" dur="5.6">Republicans, what you and your wife want</text><text start="2098.24" dur="8">to do with and for the city of Detroit.&amp;quot;</text><text start="2101.92" dur="7.12">Yeah. Tell you why that&amp;#39;s important.</text><text start="2106.24" dur="4.24">And more importantly, I said, &amp;quot;This is</text><text start="2109.04" dur="3.039">great. We appreciate you doing this.</text><text start="2110.48" dur="3.2">These are constituents these</text><text start="2112.079" dur="3.04">conservatives and Republicans don&amp;#39;t have</text><text start="2113.68" dur="4.159">a chance to talk to, and we look forward</text><text start="2115.119" dur="5.281">to that opportunity.&amp;quot; But I said, &amp;quot;Why?</text><text start="2117.839" dur="4.401">Why are you doing this?&amp;quot;</text><text start="2120.4" dur="4.8">And she said, &amp;quot;I&amp;#39;ll tell you why. on</text><text start="2122.24" dur="6.64">Saturday knocked on my door and they</text><text start="2125.2" dur="6">handed me a pamphlet and said, &amp;quot;Will you</text><text start="2128.88" dur="6.52">help us make Detroit the Democrat</text><text start="2131.2" dur="4.2">Socialist of America City?&amp;quot;</text><text start="2139.359" dur="5.361">And here&amp;#39;s the good news. She said,</text><text start="2142.24" dur="8.52">&amp;quot;I&amp;#39;ll be damned if I&amp;#39;m going to let this</text><text start="2144.72" dur="6.04">be a Democrat Socialist of America City.</text><text start="2153.68" dur="3.439">And I don&amp;#39;t know if you all know this</text><text start="2155.119" dur="4.48">and maybe you&amp;#39;re not aware, but I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="2157.119" dur="6.48">running against the most radical, most</text><text start="2159.599" dur="7.281">extreme DSI, DSA affiliated candidate in</text><text start="2163.599" dur="5.361">the country right here.</text><text start="2166.88" dur="3.68">The DSA says this is where they&amp;#39;re going</text><text start="2168.96" dur="3.36">to plant their flag and they&amp;#39;re going to</text><text start="2170.56" dur="6.36">take it from here and spread it around</text><text start="2172.32" dur="4.6">the rest of the country. this.</text><text start="2178.64" dur="4.32">Yeah, you bet. This is why we got to</text><text start="2180.88" dur="3.76">send this guy packing. And think about</text><text start="2182.96" dur="3.68">this. If you can&amp;#39;t even tell the truth</text><text start="2184.64" dur="4.4">on your resume, he lied about being a</text><text start="2186.64" dur="5.28">physician. He lied about being a dual</text><text start="2189.04" dur="4.72">citizen of Egypt. Uh he lied about being</text><text start="2191.92" dur="5.84">an immigrant from a North African</text><text start="2193.76" dur="7.04">country. Uh he lied</text><text start="2197.76" dur="4.96">over and over. This guy is hard to get</text><text start="2200.8" dur="4.08">the truth out. Matter of fact, it&amp;#39;s like</text><text start="2202.72" dur="5.32">watching an octopus put his socks on in</text><text start="2204.88" dur="3.16">the morning.</text><text start="2210.96" dur="3.92">But today, we got to expose a little bit</text><text start="2213.04" dur="4.079">about where he is. Think of this. He&amp;#39;s</text><text start="2214.88" dur="4.16">for open borders, giving illegal</text><text start="2217.119" dur="5.561">immigrants driver&amp;#39;s licenses, and</text><text start="2219.04" dur="3.64">putting them on Medicare.</text><text start="2225.68" dur="5.12">And this is really most important. So</text><text start="2227.44" dur="6">this DSA affiliated candidate is also</text><text start="2230.8" dur="5.039">taking a lot of money from organization</text><text start="2233.44" dur="6.28">that support the Muslim Brotherhood,</text><text start="2235.839" dur="3.881">Hamas and Hezbollah.</text><text start="2241.119" dur="5.921">The Muslim Brotherhood celebrated</text><text start="2243.2" dur="7.12">exactly one victory in the United States</text><text start="2247.04" dur="6.28">in the primary this year. One Abdul</text><text start="2250.32" dur="3">Elsads.</text><text start="2254.48" dur="5.44">And why are they only supporting Abdul?</text><text start="2258" dur="4.079">Well, in college, he uh was the leader</text><text start="2259.92" dur="3.919">of the Muslim Student Association, a</text><text start="2262.079" dur="4.561">feeder organization for the Muslim</text><text start="2263.839" dur="4.561">Brotherhood. In 2012, he signed a letter</text><text start="2266.64" dur="5.199">supporting the Muslim Brotherhood in</text><text start="2268.4" dur="7.4">Egypt, quoting, &amp;quot;He wanted to purge the</text><text start="2271.839" dur="3.961">press and the police.&amp;quot;</text><text start="2277.44" dur="5.76"