 we</text><text start="7516" dur="4.159">signed the agreement about two weeks</text><text start="7517.199" dur="5.361">ago. Very little coverage in the press.</text><text start="7520.159" dur="4.881">When they thought I was being a very</text><text start="7522.56" dur="4.4">difficult president, they were going</text><text start="7525.04" dur="5.76">after me. How dare he treat Europe? How</text><text start="7526.96" dur="6.48">dare he treat Denmark that way? Denmark</text><text start="7530.8" dur="5.359">was great. We own Greenland. We work it</text><text start="7533.44" dur="4.88">with Denmark. We signed a very good</text><text start="7536.159" dur="6.161">agreement with great lawyers. Infinite</text><text start="7538.32" dur="6.64">period of time. No limits, no nothing.</text><text start="7542.32" dur="4.72">I didn&amp;#39;t read any stories about it. It</text><text start="7544.96" dur="4.08">was a massive story. What a horrible</text><text start="7547.04" dur="3.44">human being. I&amp;#39;m going to go to war with</text><text start="7549.04" dur="4.32">Europe. I&amp;#39;m going to go to war with</text><text start="7550.48" dur="6.08">Denmark. Oh boy. Oh boy. These people</text><text start="7553.36" dur="5.04">are bad. But we signed and I said to our</text><text start="7556.56" dur="4.32">great first lady who says hello. I said,</text><text start="7558.4" dur="6.719">&amp;quot;First lady, this is going to be a big</text><text start="7560.88" dur="6.319">story. We just signed with the essential</text><text start="7565.119" dur="4.48">per I mean we we purchased we have every</text><text start="7567.199" dur="4.321">right you could possibly have and it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="7569.599" dur="4.56">great. We work with Denmark. Good</text><text start="7571.52" dur="4.48">country, good nice country. Anybody that</text><text start="7574.159" dur="4.96">would like to come into our country from</text><text start="7576" dur="5.52">Denmark, I&amp;#39;m all for it. But uh I must</text><text start="7579.119" dur="7.441">tell you from Somalia, I&amp;#39;m sort of I&amp;#39;ve</text><text start="7581.52" dur="7.679">had it with them. I&amp;#39;ve had it with</text><text start="7586.56" dur="4.24">I much prefer Denmark. I must say</text><text start="7589.199" dur="3.92">they&amp;#39;ll say, &amp;quot;Isn&amp;#39;t that a terrible</text><text start="7590.8" dur="5.2">thing?&amp;quot; No, it&amp;#39;s We got to be honest</text><text start="7593.119" dur="5.681">with each other, don&amp;#39;t we? Denmark,</text><text start="7596" dur="6.639">take them. Sweden, Norway. I don&amp;#39;t think</text><text start="7598.8" dur="5.68">so because I didn&amp;#39;t get the Nobel Prize</text><text start="7602.639" dur="3.44">even though I ended it. So, I don&amp;#39;t want</text><text start="7604.48" dur="4.239">anybody from Norway. I don&amp;#39;t want</text><text start="7606.079" dur="4.64">anything to do with Norway. Think of it.</text><text start="7608.719" dur="3.681">I settled eight wars and I got two more</text><text start="7610.719" dur="3.52">coming.</text><text start="7612.4" dur="4">And what did I do? I mean, I stopped the</text><text start="7614.239" dur="5.641">nuclear threat of Iran. Would have been</text><text start="7616.4" dur="3.48">terrible, right?</text><text start="7624.079" dur="3.6">And I was supposed to get it last year,</text><text start="7626.079" dur="4">but it was a little early because I just</text><text start="7627.679" dur="5.361">got into office. And the person who got</text><text start="7630.079" dur="4.401">it, Maria, was very nice. She said, &amp;quot;I</text><text start="7633.04" dur="3.84">can&amp;#39;t believe I got it. This should go</text><text start="7634.48" dur="4.56">to President Trump.&amp;quot; And she gave me her</text><text start="7636.88" dur="4.4">Nobel Peace Prize. That was so nice.</text><text start="7639.04" dur="5.36">That was very nice.</text><text start="7641.28" dur="5.12">I won&amp;#39;t forget that.</text><text start="7644.4" dur="3.92">It was very nice. And and look, I&amp;#39;m not</text><text start="7646.4" dur="3.839">saying that she was right. But I&amp;#39;m not</text><text start="7648.32" dur="3.279">saying they settled late wars. No other</text><text start="7650.239" dur="3.92">president settled the war. You know,</text><text start="7651.599" dur="4.401">Obama got the Nobel Prize about two</text><text start="7654.159" dur="4.96">weeks after he got into office. And he</text><text start="7656" dur="7.28">had no idea why he got it. And he and</text><text start="7659.119" dur="6.721">you know what? He still has no idea.</text><text start="7663.28" dur="5.12">I settled eight wars</text><text start="7665.84" dur="4.64">and two more coming. And they were wars.</text><text start="7668.4" dur="4.239">I will tell you Putin called me on one</text><text start="7670.48" dur="4.88">Azerbaijan.</text><text start="7672.639" dur="4.161">That war was raging for 34 years. He</text><text start="7675.36" dur="2.96">said, &amp;quot;I cannot believe. I&amp;#39;ve been</text><text start="7676.8" dur="3.52">trying to settle that thing for 10</text><text start="7678.32" dur="3.839">years.&amp;quot; He said, &amp;quot;I can&amp;#39;t believe you</text><text start="7680.32" dur="3.2">got it done.&amp;quot; Anyway, so when it came</text><text start="7682.159" dur="3.361">due a couple of weeks ago, they</text><text start="7683.52" dur="4.32">announced that they&amp;#39;ll be announcing in</text><text start="7685.52" dur="4.4">couple of weeks ago.</text><text start="7687.84" dur="4.48">He said to our great first lady, &amp;quot;First</text><text start="7689.92" dur="6">lady, I get the Nobel Prize in two</text><text start="7692.32" dur="5.04">weeks.&amp;quot; And uh it&amp;#39;ll be an honor. You</text><text start="7695.92" dur="4.319">know, I feel much better about saving</text><text start="7697.36" dur="5.6">all those lives. How about India and</text><text start="7700.239" dur="5.92">Pakistan? I stopped them from fighting.</text><text start="7702.96" dur="5.759">They shot down 11 planes. They&amp;#39;re both</text><text start="7706.159" dur="4.96">nuclear countries.</text><text start="7708.719" dur="5.36">The prime minister of Pakistan said,</text><text start="7711.119" dur="6.321">&amp;quot;President Trump has saved at least 30</text><text start="7714.079" dur="6.08">million lives.&amp;quot; So I said, &amp;quot;First lady,</text><text start="7717.44" dur="5.52">first lady, it&amp;#39;ll be a great honor to</text><text start="7720.159" dur="5.04">get the Nobel Peace Prize next week when</text><text start="7722.96" dur="4.719">they announce it.&amp;quot; And then I sort of</text><text start="7725.199" dur="4.561">forgot about it because I am busy. And</text><text start="7727.679" dur="4.641">it was announced that it was gotten by a</text><text start="7729.76" dur="6.399">woman that nobody ever heard of. I said,</text><text start="7732.32" dur="5.919">&amp;quot;What about me? Do they do two of them?&amp;quot;</text><text start="7736.159" dur="8.841">Think of it. I settled. So I&amp;#39;m not in</text><text start="7738.239" dur="6.761">love with Norway. Frankly, Norway sucks.</text><text start="7749.599" dur="5.161">Norway has become a house country,</text><text start="7751.76" dur="3">actually.</text><text start="7757.199" dur="6.4">Look, I was just going I can&amp;#39;t believe.</text><text start="7759.679" dur="6.4">No, I just speak the truth as No, it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="7763.599" dur="4.721">uh it&amp;#39;s crazy what&amp;#39;s going on out there.</text><text start="7766.079" dur="5.761">It&amp;#39;s called the world of politics. The</text><text start="7768.32" dur="5.2">world of politics. But we uh we&amp;#39;re</text><text start="7771.84" dur="3.92">straightening out this country at levels</text><text start="7773.52" dur="4.24">that nobody ever thought possible. When</text><text start="7775.76" dur="3.68">you think what they&amp;#39;re having in Europe,</text><text start="7777.76" dur="3.439">and it&amp;#39;s not only France now, it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="7779.44" dur="4.159">Italy. It&amp;#39;s so many different countries</text><text start="7781.199" dur="4.561">over there. It&amp;#39;s really a mess. And it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="7783.599" dur="4.64">all because they allowed people that</text><text start="7785.76" dur="3.919">hate them into their countries. They</text><text start="7788.239" dur="3.36">don&amp;#39;t like their buildings. They don&amp;#39;t</text><text start="7789.679" dur="4.4">like their art. They don&amp;#39;t like their</text><text start="7791.599" dur="4.241">people. They don&amp;#39;t like their laws. And</text><text start="7794.079" dur="3.761">that&amp;#39;s what you&amp;#39;re seeing on the streets</text><text start="7795.84" dur="3.759">right now. And we&amp;#39;re not letting that</text><text start="7797.84" dur="4.48">happen here. And we&amp;#39;re not going to let</text><text start="7799.599" dur="6.281">this guy become a senator of the United</text><text start="7802.32" dur="3.56">States of America.</text><text start="7811.04" dur="4.8">And less than two years ago, the radical</text><text start="7813.119" dur="5.761">left Democrats handed us a dark age. It</text><text start="7815.84" dur="4.879">was a dark age. We were laughed at all</text><text start="7818.88" dur="6.319">over the world. We were laughed at as</text><text start="7820.719" dur="7.041">being a foolish, a word my wife hates me</text><text start="7825.199" dur="5.121">to use. She thinks it&amp;#39;s not</text><text start="7827.76" dur="6.479">presidential. She&amp;#39;s a very elegant</text><text start="7830.32" dur="6.319">woman. She hates when I dance. She hates</text><text start="7834.239" dur="6.641">when I do weightlifting. showing that a</text><text start="7836.639" dur="8">woman can&amp;#39;t quite quite lift the same</text><text start="7840.88" dur="7.12">number of pounds as a man. You know, the</text><text start="7844.639" dur="5.44">man lifted approximately 111 pounds more</text><text start="7848" dur="6.4">than the woman.</text><text start="7850.079" dur="7.04">This was Dr. Oz. was a weightlifter, a</text><text start="7854.4" dur="4.16">failed man weightlifter who was a</text><text start="7857.119" dur="2.96">failure as a man. But then he</text><text start="7858.56" dur="4.559">transitioned very beautifully to</text><text start="7860.079" dur="6.881">womanhood and he became a weightlifter</text><text start="7863.119" dur="5.281">and he won the contest by 111 pounds, a</text><text start="7866.96" dur="5.04">record that should stand for quite a</text><text start="7868.4" dur="6">while. It was it was 19 years standing</text><text start="7872" dur="4.719">and it had an eighth of an ounce and an</text><text start="7874.4" dur="6.319">eighth of an ounce stood for 19. He</text><text start="7876.719" dur="6.641">comes along bing bing boom boom boom.</text><text start="7880.719" dur="5.36">Is that all? How crazy is this? Men and</text><text start="7883.36" dur="4.239">women&amp;#39;s sports up. She hates when I tell</text><text start="7886.079" dur="4.241">the swimming story about the great</text><text start="7887.599" dur="4.801">Olympic swimmer and she grew up with the</text><text start="7890.32" dur="5.04">same girls are all the top of the</text><text start="7892.4" dur="4.719">pyramid. She looks left and she sees all</text><text start="7895.36" dur="4.64">the girls she&amp;#39;s competed with for years</text><text start="7897.119" dur="4.401">and she looks looks right and she sees</text><text start="7900" dur="6.32">all the girls but next to her is this</text><text start="7901.52" dur="8.24">giant abs. She&amp;#39;s looking who is that?</text><text start="7906.32" dur="5.04">I&amp;#39;ve never never seen her before. She</text><text start="7909.76" dur="3.6">wants to be politically correct. You</text><text start="7911.36" dur="5.2">have to understand or they&amp;#39;ll throw her</text><text start="7913.36" dur="6.719">off and fire her and she looked up and</text><text start="7916.56" dur="5.28">this giant is there. Well, she didn&amp;#39;t</text><text start="7920.079" dur="4.401">know what to expect and they started</text><text start="7921.84" dur="6">swimming. And as you know, she was badly</text><text start="7924.48" dur="5.199">injured. You know why? Windburn.</text><text start="7927.84" dur="4.96">She suffered tremendous windburn. He</text><text start="7929.679" dur="5.92">went by her so fast that it caused</text><text start="7932.8" dur="5.12">massive windburn to her skin. And we had</text><text start="7935.599" dur="5.201">to call Bobby Kennedy Jr. to help her</text><text start="7937.92" dur="2.88">out. Right.</text><text start="7942.56" dur="5.679">So crazy.</text><text start="7945.84" dur="5.52">And their stupidity is the same exact</text><text start="7948.239" dur="5.281">way when financial matters. You know,</text><text start="7951.36" dur="5.6">the financial, they&amp;#39;ll destroy our</text><text start="7953.52" dur="6.32">country. But we had a dark age and now</text><text start="7956.96" dur="8.08">we have the golden age of America. This</text><text start="7959.84" dur="7.759">is the richest, the best. And tariffs.</text><text start="7965.04" dur="4">Tariffs. My favorite word, tariffs. Now,</text><text start="7967.599" dur="3.841">it&amp;#39;s my fifth favorite. You&amp;#39;ve heard</text><text start="7969.04" dur="3.92">that before. Because I was just</text><text start="7971.44" dur="4.08">decimated by the press. They said,</text><text start="7972.96" dur="5.199">&amp;quot;Tariffs is my favorite word in the</text><text start="7975.52" dur="6">dictionary.&amp;quot; Tariffs and the press the</text><text start="7978.159" dur="6.401">next day just decimated me because they</text><text start="7981.52" dur="5.599">said, &amp;quot;What about God? What about wife,</text><text start="7984.56" dur="3.92">family, relationship? What about all</text><text start="7987.119" dur="4.401">these other words? They&amp;#39;re so</text><text start="7988.48" dur="7.36">beautiful.&amp;quot; So now I made tariff my</text><text start="7991.52" dur="6">fifth favorite word. And I&amp;#39;m doing it.</text><text start="7995.84" dur="4.08">You know, they have another new one, and</text><text start="7997.52" dur="6.719">I knew this was going to happen. What</text><text start="7999.92" dur="6.48">did I do? Up in a certain area, not so</text><text start="8004.239" dur="7.121">far from here, you ever hear of the</text><text start="8006.4" dur="7.92">great state of Ohio, they have a man</text><text start="8011.36" dur="4.96">running named John Houston. And he was a</text><text start="8014.32" dur="4.879">humble guy, a handsome sort of a guy,</text><text start="8016.32" dur="5.279">but a humble guy. And he never said what</text><text start="8019.199" dur="6.241">a great athlete he was. He got, you</text><text start="8021.599" dur="5.281">know, they got me in this one too. And I</text><text start="8025.44" dur="2.719">thought he was he was a lieutenant</text><text start="8026.88" dur="5.359">governor, very good lieutenant governor</text><text start="8028.159" dur="6.161">but sort of quiet. He was humble and</text><text start="8032.239" dur="4.4">we were doing a speech and he was quite</text><text start="8034.32" dur="4.879">a bit behind because lieutenant governor</text><text start="8036.639" dur="4.641">but nobody knew that much about him. He</text><text start="8039.199" dur="4.801">was actually very good. He doesn&amp;#39;t talk.</text><text start="8041.28" dur="4.72">He&amp;#39;s not a talker. He&amp;#39;s a doer. Right.</text><text start="8044" dur="4.239">So</text><text start="8046" dur="3.92">I&amp;#39;m with John Gruden, the great football</text><text start="8048.239" dur="3.281">coach and he was a very good quarterback</text><text start="8049.92" dur="3.279">in college. They won the national</text><text start="8051.52" dur="4.4">championship.</text><text start="8053.199" dur="4.161">And I said, &amp;quot;John, why are you here?&amp;quot; He</text><text start="8055.92" dur="3.92">said, &amp;quot;I&amp;#39;m here for my teammate. Who&amp;#39;s</text><text start="8057.36" dur="4.879">your teammate?&amp;quot; John Houston. I said,</text><text start="8059.84" dur="6.16">&amp;quot;He played football.&amp;quot; Yeah. He was an</text><text start="8062.239" dur="5.041">all-American. He was an all-American. We</text><text start="8066" dur="3.76">had a great team. We won the</text><text start="8067.28" dur="5.12">championship and he was the best player</text><text start="8069.76" dur="5.919">in the team. And he said a couple of</text><text start="8072.4" dur="7.279">things that really hit me. He said he</text><text start="8075.679" dur="6.161">was violent. He was he would rip the</text><text start="8079.679" dur="5.121">head off people when he tackled. He</text><text start="8081.84" dur="5.839">would he was violent. He said, &amp;quot;Wait a</text><text start="8084.8" dur="5.52">minute. Are we talking about the same</text><text start="8087.679" dur="5.44">person? John said, &amp;quot;He&amp;#39;s the nicest</text><text start="8090.32" dur="5.04">man.&amp;quot; Well, he&amp;#39;s the most competitive.</text><text start="8093.119" dur="5.12">He was the best player, the fastest</text><text start="8095.36" dur="5.839">player, the hardest tackler. He was</text><text start="8098.239" dur="4.801">unbelievable. And he had a record. 17</text><text start="8101.199" dur="5.121">interceptions. Think of that. He was a</text><text start="8103.04" dur="6.559">safety defensive back. 17 interceptions,</text><text start="8106.32" dur="6">an NCAA record. He said, &amp;quot;You got to be</text><text start="8109.599" dur="5.361">kidding.&amp;quot; So I went up to the rally like</text><text start="8112.32" dur="6.16">this in Ohio.</text><text start="8114.96" dur="