at with a man before. It&amp;#39;s true.</text><text start="8193.76" dur="5.16">Off the record, women yes, men know.</text><text start="8195.92" dur="3">Okay.</text><text start="8202.399" dur="7.16">By the way, I looked at one hell of a</text><text start="8204.16" dur="5.399">beautiful ass before Nicki Minaj. That</text><text start="8211.599" dur="3.641">That&amp;#39;s hard to miss.</text><text start="8215.359" dur="6.04">That stand up. That&amp;#39;s hard to miss.</text><text start="8229.2" dur="3.76">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Okay, I&amp;#39;m going to get back to my Sorry,</text><text start="8230.96" dur="4.399">Nick. I hope Nikki wasn&amp;#39;t insulted, but</text><text start="8232.96" dur="5.84">we love Nikki. She&amp;#39;s been with us for a</text><text start="8235.359" dur="7.601">long time. But anyway, so wait. So this</text><text start="8238.8" dur="8.48">is to show you how fake the news is. So</text><text start="8242.96" dur="6.88">I revealed the story to 30,000 people</text><text start="8247.28" dur="5.039">and it&amp;#39;s in Ohio. And I said, you know,</text><text start="8249.84" dur="3.519">he was a football player and a few</text><text start="8252.319" dur="2.801">people said, yeah, he was an</text><text start="8253.359" dur="4.32">all-American. A few people do the</text><text start="8255.12" dur="4">football big football fans. But while</text><text start="8257.679" dur="3.121">he&amp;#39;s speaking, you know, ladies and</text><text start="8259.12" dur="6.16">gentlemen, thank you. My name&amp;#39;s John</text><text start="8260.8" dur="7.599">Houston. And I&amp;#39;m examining his body.</text><text start="8265.28" dur="6.96">And I said, &amp;quot;His ass was like a big</text><text start="8268.399" dur="5.841">piece of muscle. His feet were massive.</text><text start="8272.24" dur="4.479">His hands, his fingers look like</text><text start="8274.24" dur="6.079">sausages. My hands aren&amp;#39;t bad, but his</text><text start="8276.719" dur="5.84">fingers look lik