" dur="6.801">members of the military $1,776</text><text start="10194.479" dur="6.041">and everyone said, &amp;quot;Oh, that can&amp;#39;t be</text><text start="10196.24" dur="4.28">done.&amp;quot; They got the money done.</text><text start="10203.84" dur="4.8">These handsome generals, they presented</text><text start="10206.319" dur="4.561">me with 1775.</text><text start="10208.64" dur="5.2">I say, &amp;quot;Could we scr up one more dollar?</text><text start="10210.88" dur="4.64">We&amp;#39;ll have 1776.&amp;quot; That was not bad. That</text><text start="10213.84" dur="3.92">was not bad.</text><text start="10215.52" dur="4.48">The $5,000 Trump dividend is</text><text start="10217.76" dur="5.04">approximately1 trillion dollars. Think</text><text start="10220" dur="5.279">of it. So the money that&amp;#39;s being</text><text start="10222.8" dur="5.84">invested is $22.5</text><text start="10225.279" dur="5.761">trillion. The dividend cost one. We have</text><text start="10228.64" dur="4.88">more growth than any country has maybe</text><text start="10231.04" dur="4.64">ever had. We are doing better than any</text><text start="10233.52" dur="6">country has ever had. We&amp;#39;ll be able to</text><text start="10235.68" dur="6">do that. The only caveat is the Trump</text><text start="10239.52" dur="4.64">dividend, the $5,000 that you&amp;#39;ll be</text><text start="10241.68" dur="4.24">getting very shortly after the election.</text><text start="10244.16" dur="3.6">You have to promise me one thing. You</text><text start="10245.92" dur="5.24">will only spend that money of the United</text><text start="10247.76" dur="3.4">States of America.</text><text start="10255.439" dur="5.601">You will not go to France. You will not</text><text start="10258.399" dur="5.521">spend it in France. You will not spend</text><text start="10261.04" dur="5.04">it in Italy. You will not spend it in</text><text start="10263.92" dur="5.479">any other country but the United States</text><text sta