 healthcare, it sucks</text><text start="10477.6" dur="4.16">for them. You heard him say that two</text><text start="10479.04" dur="4.56">days ago. He said it sucks. Mike Rogers</text><text start="10481.76" dur="4.8">is a man who served his country in</text><text start="10483.6" dur="5.2">uniform and with great distinction</text><text start="10486.56" dur="5.04">protected us as a member of law</text><text start="10488.8" dur="5.36">enforcement and fought for Michigan and</text><text start="10491.6" dur="4.56">Congress like few others. I knew him as</text><text start="10494.16" dur="4.4">a congressman. He was a great great</text><text start="10496.16" dur="7.96">respected one of the most respected men</text><text start="10498.56" dur="5.56">in Washington DC. Mike, please come up.</text><text start="10513.279" dur="5.281">Well, thank you, Mr. President. We have</text><text start="10515.76" dur="5.28">some important work to do. You know,</text><text start="10518.56" dur="5.6">there&amp;#39;s a the Chevy Silverado is today</text><text start="10521.04" dur="4.88">being built in Mexico next year because</text><text start="10524.16" dur="4.76">of the president. It&amp;#39;s coming back to</text><text start="10525.92" dur="3">Michigan.</text><text start="10531.84" dur="5.28">Detroit Diesel just announced a third</text><text start="10534.56" dur="6.919">shift for the first time in 20 years</text><text start="10537.12" dur="4.359">right here in Michigan.</text><text start="10541.84" dur="3.36">And I&amp;#39;ll tell you what it means to have</text><text start="10543.52" dur="3.28">somebody that can actually work with the</text><text start="10545.2" dur="3.119">president on things that we would like</text><text start="10546.8" dur="3.679">to see a little different here in</text><text start="10548.319" dur="4.881">Michigan. When I was working with the</text><text start="10550.479" dur="4.8">secretary and the president&amp;#39;s office, we</text><text start="10553.2" dur="3.52">talked about, hey, I&amp;#39;ve got this problem</text><text start="10555.279" dur="3.12">that we&amp;#39;ve been talking about in</text><text start="10556.72" dur="4.559">Michigan for 20 years. we haven&amp;#39;t been</text><text start="10558.399" dur="5.841">able to get fixed. Those Canadians send</text><text start="10561.279" dur="7.961">truck after truck after truck loaded</text><text start="10564.24" dur="5">with their trash into our state.</text><text start="10572.8" dur="7.639">The president just this week announced</text><text start="10575.359" dur="5.08">he&amp;#39;s going to tariff those trash trucks.</text><text start="10590.64" dur="5.2">With your help, we&amp;#39;re going to get this</text><text start="10592.399" dur="6.801">done. Michigan, we have a state to save.</text><text start="10595.84" dur="5.519">Faith, family, freedom, our finances.</text><text start="10599.2" dur="6.6">Let&amp;#39;s get it done for the United States,</text><text start="10601.359" dur="4.441">for Michigan, for our future.</text><text start="10610.88" dur="5.28">Thank you, Mike.</text><text start="10612.8" dur="4.96">He&amp;#39;s going to be a great senator. He&amp;#39;s</text><text start="10616.16" dur="3.68">one of the most respected men in</text><text start="10617.76" dur="4.32">Washington before he even starts. And</text><text start="10619.84" dur="4.479">he&amp;#39;s going to do a great job bringing</text><text start="10622.08" dur="4.48">you everything you need. And fast. You</text><text start="10624.319" dur="4.96">also need to defeat your corrupt radical</text><text start="10626.56" dur="4.32">Democrat candidate for governor, Joselyn</text><text start="10629.279" dur="6.241">Benson.</text><text start="10630.88" dur="7.76">Jos Joselyn Benson is a disaster. What</text><text start="10635.52" dur="5.28">she&amp;#39;s done to people in this state is</text><text start="10638.64" dur="4.4">the worst voter fraud stuff that</text><text start="10640.8" dur="4.559">anybody&amp;#39;